<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gensec mulls 260 cts Randex offer.</title>
<headline>Gensec mulls 260 cts Randex offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genbel Securities Limited, the majority shareholder in Randex, on Friday said it was considering making an offer to minority shareholders of about 260 cents per Randex share.</p>
<p>In a cautionary statement to shareholders, Genbel said a further announcement on the possible offer would be published shortly.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg newsroom: +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
